{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicksharing Tycoon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicksharing Tycoon is an economic strategy in which you create and develop your own electric scooter rental company. Starting with a garage and a couple of scooters, you can build a real international corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Startup from scratch - buy your first scooters for your last $10,000 and start your entrepreneurial journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business management - assign cities for rent, monitor the condition of the fleet, hire staff and expand to new cities and countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realism and challenges - cope with vandalism and government requirements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible strategy - decide whether you will personally control the details or build a system that works without your participation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a small garage business into a leader in the global micromobility industry?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979650?t=1758003132","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979650/fb008be38e1fc1dcd09783bb9e9374c8d9b41446/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758003132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979650/8de0e73db794599380824d34653dc8b53ccb38fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758003132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979650/8de0e73db794599380824d34653dc8b53ccb38fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758003132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicksharing Tycoon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicksharing Tycoon is an economic strategy in which you create and develop your own electric scooter rental company. Starting with a garage and a couple of scooters, you can build a real international corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Startup from scratch - buy your first scooters for your last $10,000 and start your entrepreneurial journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business management - assign cities for rent, monitor the condition of the fleet, hire staff and expand to new cities and countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realism and challenges - cope with vandalism and government requirements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible strategy - decide whether you will personally control the details or build a system that works without your participation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a small garage business into a leader in the global micromobility industry?</p>","developers":["Kulix Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979650/29aac9f914569648f4d8f00fdf584376681ea084/header.jpg?t=1758003132","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257187957,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187957/movie480.mp4?t=1758003130","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187957/movie_max.mp4?t=1758003130"},"name":"KickSharing Tycoon Promo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187957/e1a4f9c0e88412e6e7848ec900d4aef74d7f4dfb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758003130","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187957/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758003130","max"